Description: Spotify now-playing desktop widget (Conky)
 Shows the current Spotify track with album art, previous/play-pause/next
 controls, a draggable seek bar, a like button and smoothly scrolling synced
 lyrics from LRCLIB. The background takes its colour from the album art, and a
 top-bar icon offers start-at-login and Quit.
 .
 Built for GNOME on Wayland (runs through XWayland).
